    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "1. W to inspect an order and its price.\n    S to pick up a dish or counter-item.\n\n2.
    Hold the item + W, then release on\n    the guest to serve or capture them.\n\n3.
    In the kitchen, drag a capture to the\n    table. Drag two ingredients to the
    pot.\n\n4. Cooking starts with a matching pair.\n    Take the finished dish to
    a guest."
